  "description": "Comprehensive library for multi-channel notification services. Includes email via\n      MailKit\n      (SMTP) and Amazon SES, WhatsApp Cloud API (Meta Graph API v23.0) with text, templates, media,\n      interactive messages, reactions, webhook validation and multi-tenant support, Scriban\n      templating\n      with caching, rate limiting, connection pooling, bulk sending, and enterprise-ready delivery\n      patterns for cloud-native .NET 10 applications.",
